  << /ActualText (Working as an Angular developer to create web applications using extensive knowledge of CSS\nand JS\057TS for providing a better user experience\056 Along with the front\055end\054 I also code in \056Net \ncore environment ensuring smooth integration of the back\055end with the front\055end\056\n\nMy Duties at\015Hard Stone include\072\nManaging the code base for the front\055end applications\056\nWork with different Angular UI libraries like Angular Material\054 Ngx\055bootstrap and Ng\055Zoro\nReview code and train junior devs with thier code practices\nCommunicate with stake\055holders and gather requirements for new features\nDeploying code on AKS \050Azure Kubernetes\051\056\015\nCoding in \056Net \050minimal API\051 for back\055end development\056\015\nUsing XMPP to implement a chat \nCoordinating with the QA team to assist in quality assurance on\015developers part\056\015\nSome of the projects on which I have worked are Xtheia \046 Sypore\056\n\nOver my time at this company\054 I have learned much things about back\055end\ndevelopment and I have worked on myteam\057code management skills\015to ensure the \napplication code base is stable and manageable\056\n\nSkills\072 Ionic\054 Angular\054 HTML\054 SCSS\054 \056Net\054 Kubernets\054 Postgresql)
